lambda_L−lambda_R + delta_d sigma = -D(k_i,h_i,g_i,a_ij) + D(k_i,h_i,b_ij,g_j) - D(k_i,c_ij,h_j,g_j) + D(d_ij,k_j,h_j,g_j).

