Abstract

These are lecture notes expanding upon a set of lectures given by G.M. at the TASI 2023
School. Part I is an introduction to topological field theory, including extended topological
field theory. Part II is an introduction to generalized Abelian gauge theories and their rela-
tion to differential cohomology.

