Some Brief Remarks On Anyons

The notion of braiding introduced in equation (8.31) turns out to be particularly well suited
to the description of anyons – particles with exotic statistics that can exist in 2+1 dimen-
sional systems. One common way of describing such particles uses 3d Chern-Simons theory

17The unitary dual of a group is the set of unitary irreducible representations of the group.

